From bb1293caac76a5d07e8bc588b7b4aaa887eb5bba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 21:43:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(od-sevev): fluid tall tabs, modals, sheets and the
 merge-ready line
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

T3 and T4 span the canvas (R-anchored header, incoming bubbles and
labels; centred system pills; stretched pinned bar, composer and
rows); the court card and its buttons stretch; the thermometer stays
L-anchored; modal cards grow by min(dx,64) and sit at 55% of a tall
safe band, never within 24 of the tab bar; settings and share sheets
are full bleed (share: the whole safe height); the O3b flash is
bottom-anchored; EVOLVE_TX centres on the canvas. Golan's round posts
a merge-ready system line with the לאחד pill (CHAT_SYS_MERGE_READY).
The diorama's ground rows follow the stage bottom and the crowd
clears the thermometer column (mobile-first §5.5-§5.13, R17 items).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
