From 2acef42d77dae0b2e26fc2a533a717a83587293b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 21:49:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] test(od-sevev): mobile-first layout math per device, web
 checks follow the fluid tabs

test_mobile_layout pins the engine's grid, width, split, tab slots,
picker plan, ticker clip, pager, modal growth and share scale against
ux/tools/mobile_layout.py --json (frozen as a fixture) for every
device of the matrix, and boots the scene at four phone backing
stores. Stage-point test helpers use the stage column (_sx). The web
checks aim the tab slots at floor4(cw/4) and the cottage at 668 + dx,
and motion_web's stage rect follows the stage column.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
